The OpenEmbedded layer for Samsung smartphones.

Machines:

  a3-2015   Samsung Galaxy A3 (2015), SM-A300F/FU/H/M (Samsung codenames
            a3lte / a3ulte / a33g), Qualcomm MSM8916. Mainline kernel port
            based on https://github.com/msm8916-mainline/linux, in the same
            shape as the tissot and rosy ports in meta-xiaomi: no Halium, no
            Android container, mesa/freedreno for graphics.

This layer depends on:

URI: git://github.com/openembedded/oe-core.git
layers: meta
branch: master

URI: git://github.com/openembedded/meta-oe.git
layers: meta-oe
branch: master

URI: this repository
layers: meta-android, meta-mainline, meta-qualcomm-modems

See conf/machine/a3-2015.conf and PORTING.md in the machine's recipe directory
for the device-specific details.
